>=20=20=20
>> On 01/31/2010 11:13:06 AM, Eric F Crist wrote:
>>=20=20=20=20=20
>>> I do not feel the forums and mailing list need to be synchronized.=20
>>> They are two different mediums, and should be treated as such.=20
